<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  FerriteLib is a prerequisite mod: it ships no Defs, no Languages and no content. Its whole payload
  is 1.6/Assemblies/FerriteLib.UiKit.dll, which consumer mods compile against by a relative sibling
  reference (Private=false, so the DLL ships only here) and bind to at runtime.

  The two version axes live apart on purpose:
    - modVersion below is the RELEASE axis, parsed by the game and readable at runtime.
    - FerriteLib.UiKit.Kernel.FerriteLibVersion.Api is the CONTRACT axis, and it is what consumers
      assert against. The harness holds that the two agree on major.minor, so this field cannot drift.

  RimWorld parses a closed tag set out of About.xml (packageId, name, shortName, author(s),
  modIconPath, modVersion, url, description, steamAppId, supportedVersions, targetVersion,
  modDependencies, load{Before,After}, incompatibleWith, forceLoad{Before,After} plus the *ByVersion
  variants) and there is no catch-all, so no custom marker tag is used here.

  Display name is confirmed as "FerriteLib", and so is the repository name (PascalCase, maintainer
  ruling 2026-09-07; the packageId stays lowercase - it is a save-data reference). License is MPL-2.0.
-->
<ModMetaData>
  <packageId>coahuilite.ferritelib</packageId>
  <name>FerriteLib</name>
  <author>Coahuilite</author>
  <modVersion>0.2.0</modVersion>
  <url>https://github.com/Coahuilite/FerriteLib</url>
  <supportedVersions><li>1.6</li></supportedVersions>
  <description>FerriteLib 是无内容前置模组：它不添加任何游戏内容（无 Def、无补丁、无贴图），全部载荷只有一个程序集 1.6/Assemblies/FerriteLib.UiKit.dll，供使用其 UI 内核的 Coahuilite 模组（目前为 Universal Squeaker）在运行时绑定。有模组依赖它时请勿卸载或禁用本模组。

FerriteLib is a no-content prerequisite mod: it adds nothing to the game (no Defs, no patches, no textures). Its entire payload is one assembly, 1.6/Assemblies/FerriteLib.UiKit.dll, bound at runtime by Coahuilite mods that use its UI kernel (currently Universal Squeaker). Do not uninstall or disable it while a mod depends on it.</description>
</ModMetaData>
